  are needed. No JIT, no unsigned executable memory, no disabled library
  validation, no privileged helper: every hardened-runtime protection stays
  at its default-secure setting. If a future capability genuinely needs one
  of these relaxed, add it here explicitly and justify it in this comment —
  never add an exception silently.
